# Self-hosted woff2 files for the site fonts. Referenced by:
#   - src/styles/app.css           (@font-face)
#   - src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro (preload links for the two critical faces)
#
# Present here (Latin subset — covers en/it/es), pulled from the Fontsource CDN
# (https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/<id>@latest/latin-<wght>-<style>.woff2):
#
#   instrument-serif-regular.woff2    (instrument-serif, 400 normal)
#   instrument-serif-italic.woff2     (instrument-serif, 400 italic)   ← preloaded
#   geist-regular.woff2               (geist, 400 normal)              ← preloaded
#   geist-medium.woff2                (geist, 500 normal)
#   geist-semibold.woff2              (geist, 600 normal)
#   geist-mono-regular.woff2          (geist-mono, 400 normal)
#   geist-mono-medium.woff2           (geist-mono, 500 normal)
#
# .gitkeep stays so the directory survives even if the woff2 files are removed.
